.TH launcher 1 "October 2026" "launcher 0.1.0-a.0"
.SH NAME
\fBlauncher\fR \- launcher and updater for IW4x
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.PP
\fBlauncher --help\fR
.br
\fBlauncher --version\fR\fR
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The \fBlauncher\fR program is the launcher and updater of IW4x\. It runs on
players' computers and on headless servers\.
.PP
In this version the program prints its usage and version\.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB--help\fR"
Print usage information and exit\.
.IP "\fB--version\fR"
Print version and exit\.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.PP
Non-zero exit status is returned in case of an error\.
